fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gstmpegvideoparser.html#GstMpegVideoPacket","fragment":"\n\tGstMpegVideoPacket\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.MpegVideoPacket\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.MpegVideoPacket\n\nMembers\nA structure that contains the type of a packet, its offset and its size\nthe data containing the packet starting at offset\nthe type of the packet that start at offset, as a GstMpegVideoPacketTypeCode\nthe offset of the packet start in bytes from data. This is the\nstart of the packet itself without the sync code\nThe size in bytes of the packet or -1 if the end wasn't found. This\nis the size of the packet itself without the sync code\nA structure that contains the type of a packet, its offset and its size\nthe data containing the packet starting at offset\nthe type of the packet that start at offset, as a GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoPacketTypeCode\nthe offset of the packet start in bytes from data. This is the\nstart of the packet itself without the sync code\nThe size in bytes of the packet or -1 if the end wasn't found. This\nis the size of the packet itself without the sync code\nA structure that contains the type of a packet, its offset and its size\nthe data containing the packet starting at offset\nthe type of the packet that start at offset, as a GstCodecParsers.MpegVideoPacketTypeCode\nthe offset of the packet start in bytes from data. This is the\nstart of the packet itself without the sync code\nThe size in bytes of the packet or -1 if the end wasn't found. This\nis the size of the packet itself without the sync code\n"});